# Normalise to LF in the repo and check out LF everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic: the hook scripts (.githooks/*, .claude/hooks/*) and
# scripts/verify.sh are POSIX shell with no file extension, and the CI gate runs
# them on ubuntu. A CRLF line ending there fails with a confusing
# `\r: command not found` rather than an honest error, so the ending is pinned
# rather than left to each clone's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The Windows launcher is the one file that genuinely wants CRLF.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Never let git rewrite bytes inside a captured archive.
*.har binary
*.mhtml binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
